  "description": "Zero-dependency marker attributes for CodeCharter's requirement-traceability\nfeature. Apply [Satisfies(\"REQ-1\")] to a type or member to declare that it justifies a\nrequirement, and [Covers(\"AC-1\")] to a test method to declare which acceptance criterion it\ncovers. This package has no runtime behavior of its own and no dependency on CodeCharter — the\nattributes are read back by name from the compiled assembly during analysis, so referencing this\npackage never couples your project to the analyzer.",
